{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52203","headline":"颂六十二首 二十八 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善恶宿薰习，感报各殊方。\n曾爲鬼害怨，或作狼讐殃。\n屠儿忆杀业，须蜜戏猕乡。\n宿佑除患者，在处游天堂。\n触类兴清遘，目击洞兼忘。\n凡圣钦嘉会，贤愚庆流芳。\n四生行善业，六趣感神光。\n苦乐虽殊别，同知命短长。\n（见同书卷三五《五通部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}